      "description": "Discover shared component props/events and UI development rules: theme variables, same-page CSS collisions/scoping, document/workspace height and registration versus host-browser validation. Full activated JS/CSS example and checklist ship in Web version source UI-DEVELOPMENT.md; obtain exact source via Author.",
